    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><div><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">你不需要睡眠，魔法效應亦無法使你陷入睡眠。你能花費4小時進行出神般的冥想來完成一次長休，且整個冥想過程中你都能保持清醒。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" />當你完成出神時，你獲得一個自選技能的熟練項，與一件自選武器或自選工具的熟練項（從《玩家手冊》中選擇它們）。你通過抽取共享的精靈記憶及星光位面的實體經歷，神祕地獲得了這些熟練，這個好處會一直持續到你完成下一次長休。</span></p></div></div></div><p>You don't need to sleep, and magic can't put you to sleep. You can finish a long rest in 4 hours if you spend those hours in a trancelike meditation, during which you remain conscious.</p><p>Whenever you finish this trance, you gain proficiency in one skill of your choice and with one weapon or tool of your choice, selected from the <span class=\"bold\">Player's Handbook</span>. You mystically acquire these proficiencies by drawing them from shared elven memory and the experiences of entities on the Astral Plane, and you retain them until you finish your next long rest.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
